speechtext:
I should like to direct a question to the Minister of Consumer and Corporate Affairs regarding the increase in the price of nickel. In view of the fact that the third company has now increased its price of nickel and the president of Chrysler has indicated that this will result in higher automobile prices, will the minister say what specific action he is taking to investigate these industries in order that these price rises can be contained?
21545-10}
Inquiries of the Ministry
